e, the winners without a scholarship who have also tacitly renounced enrolment in a position without a scholarship and those who are eligible. Those who, during the application phase, have declared that they will participate exclusively for positions without scholarship will not be able to take over positions with scholarship.\nFIRST PHASE TAKE OVER\nList of successors to the posts made available\nCandidates are required to enrol by 7 August 2025, in accordance with the provisions of art. 9 of the selection notice.\nSECOND PHASE TAKEOVER\nList of places made available - second phase\nFrom 26 August 2025, the additional available places will be published and interested candidates must submit an application for replacement by 28 August 2025 according to the procedures that will be indicated. Candidates who have applied for a takeover will be contacted directly by the office and must complete their enrolment by 2 September 2025. If interested in a position with a scholarship made available, the winners without a scholarship must also apply to take over who, within the deadlines, have tacitly renounced enrolment in a position without a scholarship.\nNo personal communications are sent.\nDomanda di subentro (32.00KB)\nApplication Compilation Tutorial\nTutorial procedura di pagamento con PagoPA\n(in english) (2.08MB)\nTutorial invio della domanda tramite piattaforma PICA (in inglese) (861.56KB)\nF.A.Q. Bando XLI Ciclo (365.30KB)\nPh.D. Office\nvia Martiri della Libert\u00e0, 8 - 35137, Padova\nPostal address: Ph.D. Office, via 8 Febbraio, 2 - 35122 Padova\nTel. 049 827 8978\nphd@unipd.it\nTelegram Channel\nTime:\nMonday: 10 a.m.-1 p.m., Tuesday: 10 a.m.-1 p.m. and 3 p.m.\u20134.30 p.m., Wednesday: 10 a.m.\u20131 p.m., Thursday: 10 a.m.\u20133 p.m., Friday: 10 a.m.-1 p.m.\nAccess to the counters in the offices is recommended upon reservation, by connecting to the https://web.unipd.it/prenotazionidottorato/ page and following the instructions on the screen.\nThe translation